OL,3,AProtests in Spain over government's
OL,4,Ahandling of Ceuta migrant crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people have protested in
OL,7,Fcities across Spain over the
OL,8,Fgovernment's handling of the influx of
OL,9,Fmigrants to the Spanish exclave of
OL,10,FCeuta on the north African coast.
OL,12,FSpanish opposition parties accuse Prime
OL,13,FMinister Pedro Sanchez of abandoning
OL,14,Fthe residents of Ceuta, while the
OL,15,Fgovernment says right-wing parties are
OL,16,Fexploiting the crisis.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
